OL,3,GNEWSA'My genius great uncle designed
OL,4,Athe most beautiful aircraft ever built'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe great-nephew of the man behind the
OL,7,FSpitfire has said he was a "genius who
OL,8,Fdesigned the most beautiful aircraft
OL,9,Fever built".
OL,11,FJulian Mitchell said, during a visit to
OL,12,Fthe Battle of Britain Air Show at IWM
OL,13,FDuxford, Cambridgeshire, that being
OL,14,Frelated to Reginald (RJ) Mitchell was
OL,15,F"incredible".
OL,17,FHe attended the special event, taking
OL,18,Fplace on Saturday and Sunday, to mark
OL,19,Fthe 90th anniversary of the maiden
OL,20,Fflight of the Spitfire.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
