OL,3,GNEWSA'My genius great uncle designed
OL,4,Athe most beautiful aircraft ever built'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts first prototype, the K5054, took to
OL,7,Fthe skies for the first time on 5 March
OL,8,F1936.
